# Nirva API Reference

Base: `/api` · OpenAPI: `/api/openapi.json` · Swagger UI: `/api/docs`

## Error format

```json
{ "error": { "code": "MISSING_PARAMS", "message": "..." } }
```

## Health & system

| Method | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| GET | `/health` | `{ status, version, uptime, services }` |
| GET | `/metrics` | Prometheus-style text |
| GET | `/system/status` | ASCII status box (Ollama/Qdrant/n8n) |

